Package: luci-app-xboxaccel
Version: 1.0.0-1
Depends: libc, luci-base, curl
Architecture: all
Installed-Size: 16
Section: luci
License: Apache-2.0
Maintainer: xboxaccel
Description: Xbox download CDN selector for OpenWrt.
 Writes dnsmasq address records so clients using this router's port 53 resolve Xbox download hostnames to a chosen CDN address.
